  "body": "Hi @infolific, does the installer work?\nI am not a windows user, I don't really know how to get around its security checks, but at the same time I am by no means suggesting that you ignore them. \nFWIW, the portable version is exactly the same as the installer version, just without the installer. Both are built from [this github action](https://github.com/artpixls/ART/actions/workflows/windows.yml). I am attaching the raw build logs here. \nDeciding whether you trust them or not is up to you of course. But if you spot something wrong and/or which should be changed to make the warning go away, please let me know.\n\nHTH\n\n[logs_45678201760.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22389468/logs_45678201760.zip)",
